{{DISPLAYTITLE:Perfumed Letter #3}}
'''Perfumed Letter #3''' is acquired by interacting with the [[Half-Buried Container]] in [[Northwind]] while in possession of [[Perfumed Letter (2)|Perfumed Letter #2]].

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
Quite chilly up here, don't you think? No worries, dearest friend, I am properly coated against any uncomfortable cold. Speaking of uncomfortable: Lady Selind is awfully cold herself. You can't blame her can you? Her nobleness is just too divine for the common man to understand. If only she could do something about it! Enough of her, back to you and my fascinating game. This one is a bit more tricky, but nothing is too hard for you, is it?

[[Weird Barrel|A vacant lookout]] over the cerulean depths.
}}

